Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: uxtheme: Scale image glyphs to the DPI and keep enlarged images sharp.
 A true-size background image is scaled to the theme DPI when its part
 sets TrueSizeScalingType = Dpi and the DPI exceeds the image's by
 TrueSizeStretchMark percent. Image glyphs were drawn at their source size
 whatever the part said. Apply the same rule to them, as Windows does.
 .
 An image made for a lower DPI than the theme DPI is enlarged by pixel
 replication when the factor is a whole number, so it stays sharp. Every
 other stretch is filtered as before.
